"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F279409741923107_122256731606281105+-+ENDORSED%21+SEIU+Local+200United%2C+a+union+of+thousands+of+members+who+are+working+people+striving+for+fair+and+just+workplaces+and+communities%2C+is+committed+to+improving+the+lives+of+families+and+workers+across+New+York+%E2%80%93+a+commitment+that+I+wholeheartedly+share.+Being+a+union+member+makes+a+big+difference%2C+and+I%E2%80%99m+proud+to+be+a+member+endorsed+by+other+members+across+multiple+organizations.+For+a+really+great+video+history+of+SEIU+and+its+impact%2C+visit%3A+www.seiu200united.org%2FaboutDelaware+County+NY+Democrats+Otsego+County+Democrats+Broome+County+Democratic+Party+Madison+County+NY+Democratic+Committee+Chenango+County+Democrats+Binghamton+City+Democratic+Committee+Town+of+Sidney+NY+Democratic+Committee+Democratic+Women+of+Broome+County+Hamilton+Democratic+Committee"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F279409741923107_122256736718281105+-+Thank+you%2C+Andrea%2C+for+your+support+and+for+your+thoughtful%2C+researched%2C+post.I%E2%80%99ve+had+the+privilege+of+speaking+with+Sherburne+residents+about+their+concerns+regarding+the+proposed+battery+storage+center%2C+and+residents+across+the+district+about+data+centers.+They+don%E2%80%99t+feel+their+best+interests+are+being+properly+represented+in+Albany%2C+and+neither+do+I.+On+Wednesday%2C+October+7%2C+I%E2%80%99ll+be+back+in+Sherburne+and+would+love+to+meet+even+more+neighbors+at+the+Sherburne+Inn+starting+at+11+a.m.I+live+in+rural+Up-State+NY.++Right+now%2C+we+are+a+target+for+battery+storage+centers+and+data+centers+since+we+have+large+land+masses+that+cost+less+than+other+places.++In+addition%2C+the+Northeast+U.S.+is+the+focus+of+data+center+builds+due+to+our+cooler+climate+and+prevalent+water+supply.+The+governor%2C+Kathy+Hochul%2C+had+presented+a+bill+to+the+NYS+legislature+to+place+a+1+year+moratorium+on+construction+of+data+centers+in+the+state+til+more+can+be+learned+about+the+affects+on+environment+and+residents.++It+is+a+great+concern+for+Up-State+citizens...however%2C+my+assemblyman%2C+Joe%2C+Angelino+voted+against+the+moratorium.+Angelino+was%2C+also+the+legislator+who+told+us+there+was+nothing+we+could+do+about+a+40+megawatt+lithium-ion+battery+storage+center+that+was+proposed+for+a+rural+residential+area+in+the+town+of+Sherburne.++%28These+centers+are+known+to+frequently+catch+fire+requiring+neighboring+residents+and+farm+animals+to+be+evacuated+in+such+an+instance%29+He+cited+a+permitting+agency%2C+ORES...+that+has+the+right+to+override+town+laws+and+blamed+the+governor.++He+was+wrong+about+the+permit%3B+the+company+did+not+receive+a+permit+through+ORES.++Since+that+proposal%2C+the+town+board+has+unanimously+approved+a+law+greatly+limiting+such+a+center%2C+placing+restrictions+on+the+proposed+build+that+would+make+it+less+likely+to+be+constructed.Both%2C+data+centers+and+lithium-ion+battery+storage+centers+pose+dangerous+risks+to+the+community.++My+question+is....Who+does+he+represent%3FI%27m+voting+for+Vicki+Davis+for+NYS+Assembly+121."
},
